pearl-job contains code ported from Pearl
(https://github.com/pearl-research-labs/pearl, commit 837c69c), crates zk-pow and
pearl-blake3:

  src/pattern.rs  <- zk-pow/src/api/proof_utils.rs (PeriodicPattern)
  src/merkle.rs   <- pearl-blake3/src/{hasher,merkle}.rs
  src/noise.rs    <- zk-pow/src/circuit/pearl_noise.rs, zk-pow/src/circuit/chip/jackpot/helper.rs
  src/job.rs      <- zk-pow/src/api/{proof,proof_utils,seed,sanity_checks}.rs (config layout,
                     seed chain and salts, nbits, difficulty bound, shape checks)
  src/mine.rs     <- zk-pow/src/ffi/mine.rs (try_mine_one)
  src/verify.rs   <- zk-pow/src/api/verify.rs (verify_plain_proof)

Changes: job-fixed 76-byte header, miner-bound seed derivation, given matrices instead
of random ones, config taken from the job instead of the proof, own proof wire format.

